        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Localized low lumbar pain, right greater than left; dull ache with occasional sharp twinge on extension or twisting in bed. Non-radicular. Daytime pain is about the same and mild, worsened by sitting too long at a desk; pain has been more noticeable at night for the past 3–4 weeks."
      }
    },
